BT 1 0 0 1 0 103.5 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12.5 TL (AgenticLiner addresses manual friction and reliability failure modes in university campus event planning. In manual campus) Tj T* (operations, organisers coordinate halls, resources, schedules, attendee registrations, and notifications without unified) Tj T* (transactional enforcement. Direct language model deployment introduces operational risks, including room double-booking,) Tj T* (capacity violations, partial state updates, and phantom notifications for uncommitted changes. AgenticLiner resolves these) Tj T* (issues through a dual-mode architecture: an autonomous Autopilot agent utilizing tool-calling capabilities with automatic) Tj T* (fallback to a deterministic sequential pipeline, paired with the Kavach safety layer. Kavach enforces invariant validation) Tj T* (across capacity limits, timetable clashes, inventory stocks, time boundaries, and notification blast radius limits within a) Tj T* (savepoint transaction with rollback, plus an outbox written after commit. The offline benchmark used a scripted planner on) Tj T* (synthetic data; in our live Gemini test, agent mode fell back to the deterministic pipeline.) Tj T* ET
