BT 1 0 0 1 0 91 Tm 12.5 TL /F3 9 Tf .117647 .160784 .231373 rg (Building Resilient, Verifiable Digital Infrastructure:) Tj /F1 9 Tf  T* (Universities require dependable operational software to coordinate complex academic, technical, and extracurricular) Tj T* (programs. AgenticLiner upgrades fragile, paper-based campus logistics into a modern, verifiable digital platform. By) Tj T* (implementing the Kavach safety layer, where every Autopilot booking runs inside a database savepoint that is rolled back if) Tj T* (a rule fails, and notices are written only after the booking commits, the platform establishes an open architecture for safe) Tj T* (autonomous agent integration. Furthermore, Module 7's participation certificates with a SHA-256 hash recorded in the) Tj T* (database and checked on the verify page \(a hash, not a digital signature\) and QR verification provide tamper-evident) Tj T* (credentials without reliance on proprietary external vendor subscriptions.) Tj T* ET
